@host = http://localhost:5051

### 1. Request OTP
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+2348166667095"
}

### 2. Verify OTP (creates the user on first success) - use the code from step 1
# @name verify
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+2348166667095",
  "code": "967976",
  "deviceId": "dev-laptop-1"
}

### 3. Check your profile with the access token
@token = {{verify.response.body.accessToken}}
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Update your profile
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Salisu Aminu",
  "email": "salisuaminu615@gmail.com"
}

### 5. Check it changed
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}